description:
Design a serial-in, parallel-out shift register with an 8-bit wide storage capability. The module captures input data on the rising edge of the shift signal, shifting the stored bits to the right and inserting the new input bit into the most significant bit position. The most significant bit (MSB) of the register is output as `out`, allowing it to represent the oldest bit of the shifted data.
module top_module(
    input in,
    input shift,
    output reg out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input in,
    input shift,
    output reg out
);reg [7:0] register;

    always @(posedge shift) begin
        register <= {in, register[7:1]};
    end

    assign out = register[7];

endmodule

