description:
Implement a Verilog module for a 3-bit ring counter with synchronous reset. The ring counter should shift its value on each positive clock edge, and if reset is high, it should reset to 3'b001.
module ring_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [2:0] q
);

code:
module ring_counter (
    input clk,
    input reset,
    output reg [2:0] q
);always @(posedge clk) begin
        if (reset)
            q <= 3'b001;
        else
            q <= {q[1:0], q[2]};
    end

endmodule

