description:
Design a D flip-flop with asynchronous reset functionality. The flip-flop captures the input data signal (D) on the rising edge of the clock (CLK), which toggles every 5 time units. Additionally, it has a RESET input to initialize the output (Q) to a predefined state and includes provisions for power and ground signals, as well as a notifier signal for handling potential issues during operation.
module top_module(
    input wire D, RESET, NOTIFIER, VPWR, VGND,
    output reg Q
);

